Already in Bea's bookstore, she misheards Pix E. thinking that she wanted a book on how to overcome her fear of hats and houses. Bea then gives her several books on how she could get over it and Bea tags along. . Bea then uses the books as stairs, but Pix E. gets dizzy trying to climb the third book. Bea then suggests that she go to Msty's. At Misty's, she suggests using hypnosis, after two incidents in which Rabbit brought two wrong things instead of a pocket watch. Misty tries to hypnotize Pix E., but ends up applying it to the pets due to her not keeping the clock right. Before Pix E. can go to Dot's house, her firefly zooms away from the road. Brody and Pix E. chase her pet firefly all over the clubhouse. The Schwartzman Quartet enter, singing "Run After Sparkly Firefly" while Brody and Pix E. continue to chase her pet firefly. When the quartet leaves, Brody and Pix E. found her pet firefly.
Pix E. goes to Dot, and she uses a fan but Pix E. ends up falling off when she uses the third boost level of it. Jewel then arrives on the scene and asks Dot for help to verify that she is fine on the canvas according to the stars and admires the attention of pix E. She, for her part, returns to the dilemma. Jewel meanwhile looks at the dresses Tippy made for her, but Jewel wears the outfit he always wears.
