Jewel then goes to Crumbs' house and asks him to please make the brilliant meals for tomorrow night, with Mouse passing out the ingredients ahead of time. Crumbs then asks Mouse to help her not eat the meals while he helps her prepare. Meanwhile Crumbs and Mouse prepare around 23 cupcakes and sprinkle them. Jewel however walks in and asks for more pancakes. Mouse tries to make his own to save time, but they don't come out right. 
